sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client / Fronting Auth Proxy
    participant GW as vllm-orchestrator-gateway<br/>8090/TCP HTTP (no TLS)
    participant Orch as FMS Guardrails Orchestrator<br/>8085/TCP baked default<br/>HTTP or HTTPS/mTLS
    participant Back as Detectors + Generation Model<br/>orchestrator-defined

    Note over Client,Back: Flow 1: Non-streaming guarded chat completion
    Client->>GW: POST /{route}/v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTP, Bearer forwarded (not validated)
    GW->>GW: Inject route detectors map<br/>(overwrites client detectors)
    GW->>Orch: POST /api/v2/chat/completions-detection<br/>TLS when certs mounted, optional mTLS<br/>Authorization + x-forwarded-* headers
    Orch->>Back: Run input detectors, generate, run output detectors
    Back-->>Orch: Results
    Orch-->>GW: JSON with choices, detections, warnings
    alt detections non-null and fallback_message set
        GW->>GW: Replace choices with single assistant fallback message
    end
    GW-->>Client: JSON response (detections + warnings passed through)

    Note over Client,Back: Flow 2: Streaming guarded chat completion (stream true)
    Client->>GW: POST /{route}/v1/chat/completions<br/>"stream": true, Bearer forwarded
    GW->>Orch: POST /api/v2/chat/completions-detection<br/>HTTP(S) streaming, optional mTLS + bearer
    Orch->>Back: Detection + generation
    loop each SSE data: chunk
        Orch-->>GW: SSE chunk
        alt chunk carries detections
            GW->>GW: Replace first choice delta with fallback<br/>finish_reason stop
        end
        GW-->>Client: SSE chunk (keep-alive)
    end
    Note over GW,Client: Chunks sent before a detection are not retracted<br/>(output guardrails on streams are best-effort)
